            "review_title": "Review at Quyen Quyen",
            "review_text": "Lam D\nHanoi, Vietnam329 contributions\n0\nFamous restaurant with \"Cơm hến\" Vietnam traditional food\nMar 2018 • Solo\nMy first impression when I go there is warmly welcome. I came here at 9'15 o'clock PM and I am a last customer before they close but they are very happy and serve me a hot and delicious meal. \"Cơm hến\" are special food here and you must try. And with Yokdoni special local wine 17.5% vol your meal will fully with local food. The price are reasonable Yokdoni wine is 110.000 VND a bottle and \"Cơm hến\" is about 60.000 VND one set. I think it is a good restaurant in Buon Me Thuot\nRead more\nWritten March 17, 2018",
