            "review_title": "Review at Quyen Quyen",
            "review_text": "Klotschen444\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam16 contributions\n0\nOne of the oldest restaurants in town.\nDec 2016 • Business\nThis restaurant has a long tradition in Buon Ma Thuot. The food is absolutely vietnamese style and very good. You should try the \"Cum Hen\" when you go there for the first time. It is very delicious!!! Also they have their own brand for traditional wine called \"Yokdoni\". Try it!\nWritten December 3, 2016",
